OL,3,GNEWSAManic Street Preachers frontman
OL,4,Afeels 'more pressure' playing in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FManic Street Preachers frontman James
OL,7,FDean Bradfield said playing in Wales
OL,8,Fbrings "extra pressure" as the band
OL,9,Fprepare to mark 35 years of their debut
OL,10,Falbum.
OL,12,FThe band will headline Blackweir Fields
OL,13,Fin Cardiff next summer, performing the
OL,14,Flandmark 1992 record Generation
OL,15,FTerrorists in full.
OL,17,FBradfield, from Oakdale near Blackwood,
OL,18,Fsaid their rock songs about banking,
OL,19,Fenvironmental damage and ideology still
OL,20,F"have a prescience for anything you
OL,21,Fcould talk about now".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
